        "Description": "These guys ovah &apos;ere say Timmy Two-Guns can&apos;t do nothing and don&apos;t even got two guns. They also claim theyz gonna buy all the copies of Pokemon Waves so no one else can get them and noone gonna be able to catch all of em. They also said you look like you&apos;d like eating the stalk part of the broccoli instead of the yummy top part of the broccoli and also that you look like a turnip on it&apos;s side. It&apos;s time we deal with these Schmucks.",
